{"records":[{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Carol V.","Carla V."],"summary":"An analyst note states that Carol V. and Carla V. may be aliases for one person or may be distinct individuals. The coreference remains unresolved, and the note recommends obtaining platform account records before selecting a canonical identity.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-analyst-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/analysis/coreference-note"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Carol V.","RedFox"],"summary":"A supplied profile excerpt displays the name Carol V. and includes a sentence denying knowledge of the RedFox message. The profile is not authenticated to the platform account in the packet, so the denial remains a source claim rather than a verified exculpatory finding.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-profile-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/profile/carol-v"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Carla V.","RedFox"],"summary":"A witness addendum reports hearing the name Carla V. near the time of the message, but the witness cannot recall the exact minute or confirm that Carla used the RedFox handle. This supports an alternative identity claim without resolving the identity or chronology.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-witness-002","source_locator":"case-c-scale/witness/addendum-1"}]},{"timestamp_text":"2026-03-04 15:20 UTC","participants":["RedFox"],"summary":"The preservation log records collection of the platform export at 2026-03-04 15:20 UTC and storage under evidence package E-01. This documents collection and chain of custody only; it does not establish when the RedFox message was sent or who controlled the handle.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-preservation-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/preservation/export-01"}]}]}